#17400
The Orchard - Credits Room~
This is a low level experience area consisting of an orchard where good pixies
and sprites battle evil imps and gremlins over the fruit.  Will be linked near
Garamond 1908 lvl range 10-20 both aligns.  Oberon
~
174 0 0 0 0 0 255 0
S
#17401
The Fenced-in Field~
You enter a small field with many cart ruts deeply engraved into the ground.  
The field has a low wooden slat fence enclosing it.  To the east and west are
gates.    
~
