#17433
Out of the Orchard~
   The gates of the faerie village are directly before you.  From here you can
peer down the main street of the village.  You see elderly faeries seated upon
mushrooms and pebbles watching their grandchildren play, while older faerie
youths stride about with their wings extended, showing off to a group of
giggling faerie schoolgirls.    
