The Town Square~
   Here, the faeries gather for meetings, festivals, markets and general
entertainment.  There is always something happening here.  You gaze admiringly
at the neatly pruned moss hedges that line the stone floored area, and at the
intricately carved fountain that sits in the center of the square.    
