#17467
The Central Hall~
   Dozens of patrons gather here day in and day out to drink, sing loud songs
and swap tall stories.  You see denizens of practically every known race (and a
few unknown) standing arm in arm singing, dancing, or challenging each other to
arm wrestles, games of darts or cards, or drinking contests.  A bar lies to the
north of here, staffed by a very busy bartender.    
~
