#17480
A Magnolia Grove~
   A grove of Magnolia trees runs along the road.  Right above the ground the
smallish branches spread outward and upward.  The trees are in bloom with
&12fragrant purple flowers.  &00 The flowers are tall and the petals curve inward.  
The branches also contain a few &09fresh green leaves&00.  White discarded petals
cover the ground.  Small brown birds dart from tree to tree sipping from the
flowers.  It is tranquil here.
~
